{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0204_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "5435af426a6e22a0cabc726fb46f72265336c5aef1682a60fe57768c65c8c350", "ja": "う、うう……ど、どうかな……\n変じゃないかな……。", "zh": "呜、呜呜……怎、怎么样呢……\n会不会很奇怪啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
