{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0204_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "69c1fb50cc7ac78844dd610a9a5c8b03e92b99b103324b962c5f8454008bcf59", "ja": "あ……う、うさぎの耳なのは、\n私だけじゃないんですね……よかった……。", "zh": "啊……原、原来长着兔子耳朵的，不只有我一个啊……太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
